# Approval workspace (PaperCraft)

## Routes (admin only)

- `/app/approvals` — queue
- `/app/approvals/:paperId` — review

Wrap in `AdminRoute`. Teachers must not access approval routes.

## Paper lifecycle

`draft` → `submitted` → `approved`

- **Approve:** `approvePaper()` sets `status`, `approvedAt`, `approvedBy`
- **Reopen:** `reopenPaperAsDraft()` → `draft` (admin only; submitted or approved)
- **Read-only builder:** `isReadOnlyPaperBuilder()` — teachers locked on submitted/approved; admins locked only on approved

## Review UI (match `paperCraftUIDesign/screens/Approval.jsx`)

- Single `ApprovalWorkspace` on both routes; left queue always visible on review
- Grid: `300px | 1fr | 320px` — `ApprovalSubmissionQueue` · `PaperOfficialPreview` · `ApprovalReviewPanel`
- Left: submission rows (`pc-approval-row`), status tabs All / Submitted / Approved
- Center: sticky `pc-float` meta strip, A4 preview, `UNDER REVIEW` / `APPROVED` watermark
- Right: Review tab only — validation checklist + summary + Approve & lock / Reopen
- Use `EmptyStatePanel` when the queue is empty
- Top bar: paper title + Approve & lock / Reopen (no Versions, Comment, Request Revisions in 2A)

## Do not add in this module without explicit request

Comments, rejection flows, PDF export, annotations, ticketing UI
